{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Road Food Simulator: Prologue solo or in Co-Op. Join other players games or start a new pizza franchise shop from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your pizza shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order pizza ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to cook pizza and make great pizzas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Box your pizzas and serve them to tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook and serve new pizza varieties as you earn money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver pizza to your customers in a pizza shop on your own or with your friends. Start with Pizza Dough and place the ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_04.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best pizza is made with teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While one makes the pizzas, another boxes the pizzas. Another delivers the pizzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_03.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, this is a fast food pizza shop! If you make pizza slowly, your customers will leave unhappy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_07_Crowd.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should prepare your pizzas quickly and put them in the oven. Get the missing ingredients. Fill your refrigerators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_02.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708130?t=1747741571","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/53763d7f6c34063dd912a96d766be04fd0a0b1a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747741571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/970d2c6feea9b7126054d145ff7d1b8c334a0875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747741571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/970d2c6feea9b7126054d145ff7d1b8c334a0875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747741571","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play Road Food Simulator: Prologue solo or in Co-Op. Join other players games or start a new pizza franchise shop from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your pizza shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Order pizza ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to cook pizza and make great pizzas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Box your pizzas and serve them to tables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook and serve new pizza varieties as you earn money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver pizza to your customers in a pizza shop on your own or with your friends. Start with Pizza Dough and place the ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_04.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The best pizza is made with teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While one makes the pizzas, another boxes the pizzas. Another delivers the pizzas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_03.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, this is a fast food pizza shop! If you make pizza slowly, your customers will leave unhappy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_07_Crowd.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should prepare your pizzas quickly and put them in the oven. Get the missing ingredients. Fill your refrigerators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/extras/rfs_gif_02.gif?t=1747741571\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["2MEDYA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708130/2122d1c8e1c21cbb3b5364bf58699bd24e64302e/header.jpg?t=1747741571","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132288,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132288/movie480.mp4?t=1746859009","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132288/movie_max.mp4?t=1746859009"},"name":"Road Food Simulator Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132288/ecfde0c27e0555fdfd72e67cccf9e54b628d736f/movie_600